# LEIS public portal

Read `AGENTS.md` before making product changes. It is the source of truth for
authorship, public claims, language completeness and visual direction.

Stack: React 19 + TypeScript + Vinext/Vite + Cloudflare Sites. Main public UI:
`app/page.tsx`; styling: `app/globals.css`.

Work in complete, coherent feature groups. Do not make a string of tiny visual
patches. Use targeted file context, show a compact diff, then run
`npx vinext build --verbose` once for the completed group.

Do not add packages or external services unless explicitly requested. Keep the
public site privacy-preserving and do not reveal archive contents.

Any public visible text must be translated in EN, CS, DE, FR and ES. Do not
release a partial locale. Preserve original language titles and URLs for public
sources.

LEIS is free, not an AI product and not a paywall. Martin Pužík is the founder,
creator and constitution author. M.A.J. Pužík provides technical activation and
development support; do not misrepresent authorship.
